specific.dev — mirrored 2026-08-24 (D38) via mirror_site.py (depth 6) into specific/. Site is a Next.js static export ("Specific — Cloud platform built for coding agents"; YC F25 — one-liner "AWS for coding agents"; founders Fabian Lindfors + Iman Radjavi, foundingDate 2025 in schema.org JSON-LD). YC batch record (F25) = funded ≤24 months; AI focus ✓ (coding-agents infra). Canonical host https://specific.dev/, robots.txt: allow-all (no Disallow; Sitemap: https://specific.dev/sitemap.xml listed). Cloudflare-fronted. 62 on-disk files (3.5 MB): 12 HTML routes (10 real page routes + 2 Next.js og-route shells), 14 JS (Next chunks), 17 woff2 (self-hosted fonts), 2 css, 11 raster (7 png + 2 jpeg + 2 jpg), 5 svg, cdn-cgi email-protection artifact. Served via serve_replica.py on 8937 (hub d38-specific-8937).

Routes mirrored (all HTTP 200 / 404-faithful): / (home), about/, blog/ + 3 posts (build-with-specific-task-board, run-temporal-locally, what-is-durable-execution), careers/, changelog/, pricing/, tos/. /docs is a DEAD NAV LINK ON LIVE (404) — mirrored as 404 for faithful parity, so only 10 real routes. opengraph-image/ + changelog/opengraph-image/ = og-route HTML shells (bare path 301s; og:image meta keeps the absolute https://specific.dev/?2b9073564a4e0222 URL — live-only identity ref, per cross-host precedent).

Canonical-only refs (NOT fetched by the page, therefore unmirrored like sitemap.xml): logo.svg appears only inside schema.org JSON-LD + Next RSC payload strings (never as an <img src> — the nav logos are logos/{cursor,claude,codex}.svg); sitemap.xml listed in robots.txt (metadata). Both 404 on replica with zero visual/content impact. docs.specific.dev, github.com/specific-dev, x.com/specific_dev, YC company page = real outbound links (live). PostHog /ph/ analytics endpoint left external (live-only beacon; see probe note).

Cloudflare email-protection: contact links are obfuscated cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#… hrefs — mirrored byte-identical; the mailto:text lives in CF's JS at runtime, live-only. No broken images or missing referenced assets either side.

